# Deterministic input script: "frame pressed key". Events for frame N enter the
# key FIFO after frame doorbell N. Keys are doomkeys.h codes.
# Walk forward, turn right, fire twice, turn left, walk, open nothing.
50  1 0xad   # up arrow: forward
90  0 0xad
90  1 0xae   # right arrow: turn right
104 0 0xae
105 1 0xa3   # fire
107 0 0xa3
125 1 0xa3
127 0 0xa3
140 1 0xac   # left arrow: turn left
160 0 0xac
160 1 0xad
200 0 0xad
